category: Libs
build-depends: cygport libsbml-devel
sdesc: "Numerical Markup Language (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "The Numerical Markup Language (NuML) aims to standardize the exchange and
archiving of numerical results. NuML originates from the numerical aspects of
the Systems Biology Results Markup Language (SBRML) with the aim of re-using
it in multiple other standardization efforts."
skip:

homepage: https://github.com/NuML/NuML
license: LGPL-2.1-or-later
